---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Methodology" description="How Kuma Blog distinguishes evidence, observation, and opinion.">
  <main id="main-content" data-pagefind-body>
    <article class="reading-column">
      <p class="eyebrow">Methodology</p>
      <h1>Evidence before polish</h1>
      <p>
        Published work distinguishes sourced facts, direct observations,
        inferences, and opinions. Experiments state their environment,
        limitations, and failure modes. Scanner findings are review cues, not
        authorship claims or deletion verdicts.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
